18
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:14,391
Dolphin and SERV cannot sign, submit, or override the verdict. Sui,

19
00:01:14,391 --> 00:01:20,076
Walrus, Tatum, and the wallet pipeline stay deterministic. Janus, with

